{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊國號高代名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞。岳。天。灌。\n智。慧。朗。然。邃。是九天台祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。\n八宗由來如斯"}
